@startuml
!include style.puml

skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam componentFontColor #FFFFFF
skinparam componentFontSize 15
skinparam componentFontName Arial

component Main #grey
component UI UI_COLOR
component Logic LOGIC_COLOR
component Model MODEL_COLOR
component Storage STORAGE_COLOR
component Commons LOGIC_COLOR_T2

Main ..> UI : initialises
Main ..> Logic : initialises
Main ..> Model : initialises
Main ..> Storage : initialises
UI ..> Logic
UI ..> Model
Logic ..> Model
Logic ..> Storage
Storage ..> Model

note bottom of Commons
  Shared utilities used across components.
  These dependencies are omitted for clarity.
end note

Commons -[hidden]up- Model
@enduml
